WEBVTT

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.130
Hey, Luka...

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:17.060
Are you sure about this?

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:19.410
About what?

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.600
Are you sure you don't need
to be at Yuki-chan's side?

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:26.620
Yes. Elegy wants me.

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:31.670
Staying with him will only
put him in danger.

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:35.030
Besides, I'll know how he's doing,
as long as I'm with Tsukumo.

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:37.540
Are you sure that's all?

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:39.460
Didn't you just...

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:40.790
Don't say it.

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:44.640
Luka...

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:48.960
Don't tell Yuki.

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:51.970
Please...

00:00:57.580 --> 00:00:58.800
Yuki...

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:08.070
Luka...

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:17.700
Only I know your pain...

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:20.200
Your uncertainty...

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:23.540
Your loneliness...

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:28.380
If only we could be together forever.

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:34.720
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:44.940
I will not betray you!

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:29.910
Sin and Punishment and Promise

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:42.500
Are you sad, not getting to see Luka?

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:48.650
Where do you suppose Luka is?

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:50.800
You're worried about him?

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:52.740
Kuroto-kun.

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:59.110
I heard he's not injured,
but I can't help worrying...

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.360
It is an ominous night.

00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:06.460
The clouds are moving quickly.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:10.570
Just like that time.

00:04:10.570 --> 00:04:14.900
On nights like this, he always
seems to be nearby.

00:04:15.470 --> 00:04:16.290
Who?

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:19.660
Cadenza. Our enemy.

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:24.030
Our? You mean Senshiro's, too?

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:28.550
Senshiro isn't meant to fight.

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:30.480
I'm sure he knows well enough that

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:35.060
nothing will come of hatred
and vengeance. That's why...

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:36.560
That's quite a way to say it.

00:04:38.390 --> 00:04:40.020
Senshiro-san...

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:41.150
You were listening?

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:42.600
Yes.

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:43.900
Perfect.

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:45.480
Quit this job.

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:48.490
Why would you say that?

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:49.070
Kuroto!

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:52.490
I am the only one he's after.

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:55.780
You can still turn back.

00:04:58.460 --> 00:04:59.600
Kuroto...

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:04.420
Senshiro-san...

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:08.420
Sorry you had to witness that.

00:05:08.420 --> 00:05:09.340
Um...

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:14.050
I think Kuroto-kun just doesn't want
you getting caught up in it.

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:18.520
He knows your kindness
better than anyone.

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:22.950
I know what Kuroto's thinking.

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:23.480
Huh?

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:25.430
Good night.

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:36.950
Something on your mind?

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:38.760
Fuyutoki-san.

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:42.900
Why don't you return to your room and rest?

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:44.790
Okay...

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:50.580
Talking may help you feel better.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:51.050
Huh?

00:05:55.630 --> 00:06:00.140
A person can carry barely anything alone.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:05.770
If they really care about each other,

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:10.720
what can they do for each other?

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:16.210
Perhaps there is happiness

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:18.280
in simply being able to do
something for the other.

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:18.990
What?

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:23.480
All I can do is wait.

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:30.170
The one I love still struggles by himself...

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:33.420
Struggles?

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:39.470
I wish I could be by his side,
sharing his joy and suffering.

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:52.610
Isn't it painful?

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:55.660
Some relationships are like that.

00:06:57.080 --> 00:07:01.380
Luka-san and I might be the same way.

00:07:01.380 --> 00:07:02.120
Huh?

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.180
Yomi,

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:27.100
if you were alive,

00:07:27.100 --> 00:07:30.110
would you be laughing at our foolishness?

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:34.240
At how we burn ourselves
in the flames of battle?

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:42.420
Reiga-dono, for what purpose
did you summon us?

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:47.750
Give us some orders.
Tell us to kill them.

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:53.740
Not yet. It's not time for that...

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:09.310
What a pleasure to see you again,
master killer Cadenza.

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:14.320
Did you lose your fangs,
playing with humans?

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:16.780
What are you trying to say?

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:21.480
Nothing. All I want is Zess...

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:34.880
Yuki did what?

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:39.930
Yes. It seems he left before daybreak.

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:42.140
How did this happen?

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:43.930
I'm sorry.

00:08:43.930 --> 00:08:47.920
It may have been something I said.

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:51.720
I believe he may have left
to search for Luka-sama.

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:53.610
I see.

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:57.150
Don't let it bother you.
It's not your fault.

00:08:59.710 --> 00:09:01.320
That's just how he is.

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:05.950
He cares more for others'
pain than for his own.

00:09:07.390 --> 00:09:08.900
That's just how he is...

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:13.870
Sheesh...

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:17.730
If they're going to summon us now, they should
have just invited us to begin with.

00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:21.380
And now Toko and Tsukumo
have snuck out, too.

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:23.950
It seems the situation has changed.

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:25.260
What do you mean?

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:30.390
According to Tachibana-san,
Luka fought a General Class.

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:34.430
What? Why didn't you tell me
something this important?

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:35.950
I'm telling you now.

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:36.610
Huh?

00:09:36.610 --> 00:09:40.640
I knew you would figure it out,
once we arrived in Kamakura.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.320
Why, you...

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:44.910
Is Luka all right?

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:46.140
Yes.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:49.870
I see. Well, I guess he
isn't one to die easily.

00:09:49.870 --> 00:09:53.870
If they're calling all the Zweilts...

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:56.210
This is it.

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:57.840
Yes.

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:07.180
What? Yuki did?

00:10:07.180 --> 00:10:11.360
Yes. He left the mansion at dawn.

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:13.940
You don't know where he went?

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:14.940
No.

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:17.660
Do you two know anything about this?

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:29.200
What's wrong? Did you have a fight?

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:30.740
It's nothing.

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:32.260
Hey!

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:33.580
I'm going to look for Yuki.

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:40.440
What's wrong with them?

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:42.940
We should search the area, as well.

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:44.130
Right.

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:55.420
Now, what will we catch?

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:03.480
Tsukumo, why did Yuki-chan
leave the mansion?

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:07.320
I don't know, but Kuroto and Senshiro
have gone outside, too.

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:18.680
Damn it, where is Yuki?

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:20.750
Kuroto.

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:23.880
Did you really mean what
you said yesterday?

00:11:26.690 --> 00:11:28.910
This isn't the time.

00:11:31.780 --> 00:11:33.580
Would you be okay alone?

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:36.150
What about dinner?
What about your clothes?

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:39.590
If I'm not driving, you even
get carsick. And you-

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:40.810
Why, you...

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:47.120
I don't intend to leave you.

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:50.140
No matter who despises me...

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:52.350
No matter who crushes me underfoot...

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:54.330
Even if the world abandons me...

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:58.230
I will stay by your side until the very end.

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:03.140
I wish you wouldn't doubt me.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:15.930
Caught one.

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:32.200
Not just anyone, either.

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:35.170
Luka?

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:37.000
Huh?

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:41.050
Kuroto, is this...

00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:43.410
Yes, it's a barrier.

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:55.870
Sodom!

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:59.450
Pleased to meet you, God's Light.

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:04.890
Cadenza!

00:13:11.230 --> 00:13:16.370
We finally meet again,
and this is how you greet me,

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:18.200
Zweilt of the Black Sword?

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:19.580
Cadenza!

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:24.040
This Death Scythe wielder
must be your new partner.

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:26.340
Cadenza?

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:29.260
Your enemy.

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:33.760
I thought I would greet the new God's Light.

00:13:34.760 --> 00:13:37.600
But it seems you have come again,
to delight me with your screams.

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:39.600
Just like that day...

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:47.820
Senshiro!

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:57.400
You seem to have found a good partner.

00:13:57.990 --> 00:14:01.200
Kuroto-kun. Senshiro-san...

00:14:05.680 --> 00:14:07.210
You still have a long way to go!

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:09.290
Cadenza!

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:13.880
Those two have no hesitation.

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:19.560
A tremendous will to kill...

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:21.720
An ominous hatred...

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:25.480
But... But this...

00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:30.860
Senshiro isn't meant to fight.

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:35.410
<i>I'm sure he knows well enough that</i>

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:37.490
<i>nothing will come of hatred
and vengeance.</i>

00:14:38.470 --> 00:14:41.230
Is this really...

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:53.920
What a splendid look in your eyes.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:57.910
As a reward, I will play your game seriously.

00:14:58.420 --> 00:15:01.430
Are you ready, Zweilt?

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:08.530
What do you mean,
you don't know where Yuki-chan is?

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:11.070
Yuki's presence suddenly vanished.

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:12.030
What?

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:14.180
There must be some kind of barrier.

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:15.070
But...

00:15:15.070 --> 00:15:18.200
I can still find the area
where he disappeared.

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:19.950
Yuki...

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:26.920
What happened?

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:29.900
It was over in a mere second.

00:15:39.150 --> 00:15:40.850
Damn it...

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:47.390
This is a General Class Opast...

00:15:58.830 --> 00:15:59.700
Kuroto...

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:02.250
Over already?

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:06.660
That old man put up a much greater fight.

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:10.920
Don't talk about him with
your filthy mouth...

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:14.120
Is your language the only
thing that has matured?

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:17.710
Do not disappoint me, Zweilt
of the Black Sword.

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:20.370
Kuroto-kun!

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:24.060
Stop!

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:32.610
Are you eager to die, as well, God's Light?

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:42.200
Humans are curious creatures.

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:46.080
When the ones they love are
in danger, they leap to arms,

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:48.900
rising over and over,
no matter how many times they fall.

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:53.710
I would even say I have a soft spot for you.

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:59.080
However, if they were to lose you,
their only hope,

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:01.950
humankind would be stained with despair.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:06.640
It would be interesting to see if
that would extinguish all light.

00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:09.930
Don't you agree, God's Light?

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:11.900
Yuki...

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:13.860
Yuki-kun...

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:16.040
You can't do it.

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:17.230
What?

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:23.380
Killing me won't erase the will of others.

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:29.910
Kuroto-kun and Senshiro-san's
loved ones live on in their hearts.

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:32.350
The time they spent together...

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:34.480
The feelings they shared...

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:40.160
Their lives' proof endures within us.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:44.550
There is nothing you can take from us.

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:48.390
Not a single thing of importance.

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:50.410
Very well.

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:54.850
Then show me this proof yourself.

00:17:58.280 --> 00:18:02.200
Killing you quickly violates
my aesthetic, but...

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:05.260
Die, God's Light!

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:06.910
What?

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:08.200
Kuroto-kun.

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:09.810
You are bound!

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:21.110
Senshiro!

00:18:21.110 --> 00:18:22.190
Senshiro-san!

00:18:22.630 --> 00:18:23.910
Run, Kuroto!

00:18:25.110 --> 00:18:28.870
As Zweilts, it's our job to protect Yuki-kun.

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:30.640
Yuki-kun.

00:18:32.010 --> 00:18:35.140
I was saved by your words.

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:36.890
Interesting.

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:47.850
You return from the brink of death
to sacrifice yourself,

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:51.910
and you tell your friends to live?

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:54.330
I'm a sore loser!

00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:57.920
Then I shall carve it in your flesh.

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:01.500
You cannot defeat me!

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:04.790
Senshiro-san!

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:05.380
Yuki.

00:19:05.380 --> 00:19:05.760
What?

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:07.960
Can you make it to the mansion by yourself?

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:12.250
I can't stop Cadenza by myself.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.850
But you'll...

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:15.850
Go.

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:16.680
But...

00:19:16.680 --> 00:19:19.810
You're our only hope.

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:24.150
Please.

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:26.760
Go!

00:19:44.130 --> 00:19:46.840
Why did you come back, Kuroto?

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.430
Didn't you say you'd live by my side?

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:53.410
Stop...

00:19:54.350 --> 00:19:57.850
I should thank you for entertaining
me so long.

00:19:58.570 --> 00:20:01.310
Now die by the sword of your beloved.

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:03.900
Stop...

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:06.440
<i>Stop!</i>

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:17.330
This is...

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:21.880
the holy white wall, Hallowed Wall.

00:20:24.770 --> 00:20:25.880
Yuki-kun.

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:27.260
Yuki...

00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:31.430
More than enough blood has been spilled.

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:36.020
I can't sit by and watch,
while my friends come to harm.

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:39.690
That damn woman's special technique.

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:41.900
Then I shall break through!

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:46.940
The Hallowed Wall requires a massive
amount of energy.

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:49.820
How long can you keep this up?

00:20:51.490 --> 00:20:52.360
Yuki-kun!

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:53.530
It's fine! Just stop!

00:20:53.530 --> 00:20:56.040
What? Over already?

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:03.960
It's no use. I can't keep this up.

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:07.340
He'll break through.

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:12.770
Is that...

00:21:12.770 --> 00:21:14.650
The barrier fell!

00:21:18.010 --> 00:21:19.270
It must be...

00:21:35.630 --> 00:21:40.080
I do not recall ordering you
to do this, Cadenza.

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:43.000
If it isn't Reiga-dono.

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:47.440
Kanata-san...

00:23:37.760 --> 00:23:41.710
Sodom, are you drying my hair for me?

00:23:45.130 --> 00:23:45.980
Don't force yourself, Sodom!

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:47.040
The Indelible Image
Don't force yourself, Sodom!

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:49.860
I'll dry my hair myself!
The Indelible Image

00:23:49.860 --> 00:23:49.950
I'll dry my hair myself!
